{
  "$comment": "mirrored facts of the team kit, each declared once; check-mirrors.mjs verifies every site. a site is file + at (anchor text, matched on flattened text) + to (end anchor) or lines (default 1, counted from the anchor's line); no at = the whole file. sources are read from the tree under check. limits: tokens prove a rule's words are present at a site, not that the sentence still means the rule (a negated or paraphrased copy passes), and banned phrases catch stale wordings, not paraphrases of them.",
